New monk skill: sew.

1) Sew makes clothing or light armor from a skein, sized to any race.
   - It is the forge's mirror: the skein's grade decides how much of the
     stats it carries come through.
   - A missed stitch costs the piece and wastes thread off the skein.

2) Hardness caps the tier here as everywhere.
   - Leather reaches light armor.
   - Silk, however fine, never leaves clothing.

See HELP SEW and HELP WEAVE.
